[{"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:55:56", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "55", "end_line": "56", "text": "- Add tests for every grammar change before moving to next rule.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "cross_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:56:61", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "56", "end_line": "61", "text": "- For grammar edits, required loop:\n  1. update `td_sql.y`\n  2. regenerate with `goyacc`\n  3. add/adjust targeted unit tests\n  4. run full `go test ./...`\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "cross_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:5:6", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "5", "end_line": "6", "text": "- Grammar source: `td_sql.y` (edited by contributors).\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:61:62", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "61", "end_line": "62", "text": "- Prefer branch-covering tests for new alternatives (empty branch + each non-empty branch).\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "cross_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:62:63", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "62", "end_line": "63", "text": "- For parity work, run `make parser-hard-gate` before considering a task complete.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "cross_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:63:65", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "63", "end_line": "65", "text": "- `reports/final/*.md` and `reports/query/*.md` are generated artifacts and should be refreshed by the gate when grammar/statement behavior changes.\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "cross_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:65:66", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "65", "end_line": "66", "text": "## Commit & Pull Request Guidelines\n", "t": "description", "p": "Development Process", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:66:69", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "66", "end_line": "69", "text": "- Follow Conventional Commit style used in history, e.g.:\n  - `feat(sqlparser): ...`\n  - `refactor(sqlparser): ...`\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:69:74", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "69", "end_line": "74", "text": "- PRs should include:\n  - summary of grammar branches migrated\n  - updated/added tests\n  - `goyacc` conflict count before/after\n  - parity/coverage impact when relevant\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:6:7", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "6", "end_line": "7", "text": "- Generated parser: `sql.go` and debug table `y.output` (generated via `goyacc`).\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:74:75", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "74", "end_line": "75", "text": "- Never modify files under `lemon/`; it is the migration baseline.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:75:76", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "75", "end_line": "76", "text": "- Do not commit local build artifacts under `build/`.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:7:8", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "7", "end_line": "8", "text": "- Lexer and keywords: `lexer.go`, `keyword.go`.\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:8:9", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "8", "end_line": "9", "text": "- AST and statement nodes: `ast.go`, `expr_*.go`, `stmt_*.go` (including temporary `*_stub.go` files used during migration).\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "d9337f7229f46d5a8dbd:9:10", "repo": "taosdata/TDengine", "file_path": "test/go-sql-fuzz-test/sqlparse/AGENTS.md", "start_line": "9", "end_line": "10", "text": "- Lemon reference grammar (do not modify): `lemon/`.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "d9d2a5592bf823229ee2:1:3", "repo": "thedaviddias/Front-End-Checklist", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "1", "end_line": "3", "text": "# Project Guidance\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "System Overview", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "d9d2a5592bf823229ee2:3:5", "repo": "thedaviddias/Front-End-Checklist", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "3", "end_line": "5", "text": "Use [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for repository conventions, workflows, and tool setup.\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Documentation", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "d9d2a5592bf823229ee2:5:6", "repo": "thedaviddias/Front-End-Checklist", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "5", "end_line": "6", "text": "Local Claude Code session state belongs in `.claude/`, which is ignored by git and should not be committed.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:101:103", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "101", "end_line": "103", "text": "**Pattern**: Services coordinate between stores (writes) and read models (reads). Controllers call services or read models, never stores directly.\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:103:105", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "103", "end_line": "105", "text": "## Development Philosophy\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "System Overview", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:105:107", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "105", "end_line": "107", "text": "We follow three core principles:\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "System Overview", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:107:108", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "107", "end_line": "108", "text": "1. **Test code always** - We test our code and prefer automation over manual testing\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:108:109", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "108", "end_line": "109", "text": "2. **Write maintainable code** - Code is communication; clarity and readability are paramount\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:109:111", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "109", "end_line": "111", "text": "3. **Think before committing** \n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:10:12", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "10", "end_line": "12", "text": "- **Frontend**: React/TypeScript single-page application (`/frontend`)\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:111:113", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "111", "end_line": "113", "text": "## Coding Standards\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:113:114", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "113", "end_line": "114", "text": "Detailed standards are documented as Architectural Decision Records (ADRs). They can be located:\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:114:115", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "114", "end_line": "115", "text": "- /contributing/ADRs/back-end/\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:115:116", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "115", "end_line": "116", "text": "- /contributing/ADRs/front-end/\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:116:118", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "116", "end_line": "118", "text": "- /contributing/ADRs/overarching/\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:118:120", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "118", "end_line": "120", "text": "Instead of `!!someVariable` prefer `Boolean(someVariable)`. \n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "content", "c": "none"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:120:122", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "120", "end_line": "122", "text": "## Database Migrations\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:122:123", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "122", "end_line": "123", "text": "- Migrations live in `/src/migrations/`\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:123:124", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "123", "end_line": "124", "text": "- Never modify a merged migration; create a new one instead\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:124:125", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "124", "end_line": "125", "text": "- Each migration needs `up` and `down` methods\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:125:127", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "125", "end_line": "127", "text": "- Use `pnpm db-migrate create <name>` to create new migrations\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Build and Run", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:127:129", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "127", "end_line": "129", "text": "## Testing\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:129:130", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "129", "end_line": "130", "text": "- **Backend**: Vitest + Supertest for API testing; fake stores for isolation\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:12:14", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "12", "end_line": "14", "text": "**Enterprise** extends OSS via a separate repository (`unleash-enterprise`) using a hook-based architecture. Enterprise does not fork OSS; it injects additional functionality through `preRouterHook`. If the user says that this is an enterprise feature, you need to ask where the enterprise repository is located and work across both this repository and the enterprise repository. \n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "AI Integration", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:130:131", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "130", "end_line": "131", "text": "- **Frontend**: Vitest + Testing Library\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:131:133", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "131", "end_line": "133", "text": "- **E2E**: Cypress (`/frontend/cypress/`)\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:133:140", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "133", "end_line": "140", "text": "Run tests with:\n```bash\npnpm test          # All tests\npnpm test:frontend # Frontend only\npnpm test:backend  # Backend only\n```\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:140:142", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "140", "end_line": "142", "text": "## Critical Files Reference\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:142:143", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "142", "end_line": "143", "text": "### OSS Entry Points\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:143:152", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "143", "end_line": "152", "text": "| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `/src/server.ts` | Main entry point |\n| `/src/lib/app.ts` | Express app setup, middleware stack |\n| `/src/lib/routes/index.ts` | Route registration |\n| `/src/lib/services/index.ts` | Service factory |\n| `/src/lib/db/index.ts` | Store factory |\n| `/src/lib/types/index.js` | Importing types | \n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:14:16", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "14", "end_line": "16", "text": "## Architecture\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:152:164", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "152", "end_line": "164", "text": "### Pattern References\n| Pattern | Example Location |\n|---------|-----------------|\n| Controller | `/src/lib/features/feature-toggle/feature-toggle-controller.ts` |\n| Service | `/src/lib/features/feature-toggle/feature-toggle-service.ts` |\n| Store (write model) | `/src/lib/features/feature-toggle/feature-toggle-store.ts` |\n| Read Model | `/src/lib/features/feature-search/feature-search-read-model.ts` |\n| Composition Root | `/src/lib/services/index.ts` |\n| API Hook (GET) | `/frontend/src/hooks/api/getters/useFeature/useFeature.ts` |\n| API Hook (mutation) | `/frontend/src/hooks/api/actions/useFeatureApi.ts` |\n| Fake Store | `/src/test/fixtures/fake-feature-toggle-store.ts` |\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:16:18", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "16", "end_line": "18", "text": "### Backend (`/src`)\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:18:20", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "18", "end_line": "20", "text": "The backend follows a **CSR (Controller, Service, Repository/Store)** pattern. We promote packages by feature, not by layer (see feature-based modules below), although the legacy components are still packed by layer:\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:1:3", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "1", "end_line": "3", "text": "# Agent Instructions for Unleash\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "System Overview", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:20:21", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "20", "end_line": "21", "text": "- **Controllers** (`/src/lib/routes/`): Handle HTTP requests, validate input, delegate business logic to services, and demarcate transactions.\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:21:22", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "21", "end_line": "22", "text": "- **Services** (`/src/lib/services/`): Business logic layer, emit events, manage transactions\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:22:24", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "22", "end_line": "24", "text": "- **Stores** (`/src/lib/db/`): Data access layer using Knex query builder\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:24:26", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "24", "end_line": "26", "text": "**Feature-based modules** live in `/src/lib/features/` where each domain contains its own controller, service, store, and types. Examples: `feature-toggle`, `project`, `segment`, `change-request`, `release-plans`.\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:26:27", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "26", "end_line": "27", "text": "**Key Patterns**:\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:27:28", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "27", "end_line": "28", "text": "- **Audit-log**: Services emit typed events (`FeatureCreatedEvent`, etc.) for audit trails and read model updates\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:28:29", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "28", "end_line": "29", "text": "- **Transaction wrapper**: Use `withTransactional()` for atomic operations across services. The common pattern is initiating transactions at the controller level.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:29:30", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "29", "end_line": "30", "text": "- **Fake implementations**: Every store/service has a Fake variant for testing (prefer over mocking)\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:30:32", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "30", "end_line": "32", "text": "- **Internal feature flags**: `flagResolver.isEnabled()` controls operational features\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:32:34", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "32", "end_line": "34", "text": "**Stack**: Express, PostgreSQL with Knex, TypeScript with ES modules\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:34:36", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "34", "end_line": "36", "text": "### Frontend (`/frontend/src`)\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:36:38", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "36", "end_line": "38", "text": "The frontend is a React SPA communicating with the backend via REST API.\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:38:39", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "38", "end_line": "39", "text": "- **Components**: `/frontend/src/component/` - React components organized by feature domain\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:39:40", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "39", "end_line": "40", "text": "- **Hooks**: `/frontend/src/hooks/` - 71+ custom hooks for data fetching and mutations\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:3:5", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "3", "end_line": "5", "text": "This document provides AI coding assistants with context about the Unleash codebase. It is tool-agnostic and can be referenced by any AI assistant configuration.\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:40:42", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "40", "end_line": "42", "text": "- **Contexts**: `AccessContext` (permissions), `UIContext` (toasts, theme)\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:42:43", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "42", "end_line": "43", "text": "**Key Patterns**:\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:43:44", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "43", "end_line": "44", "text": "- **Data fetching**: SWR-based `useApiGetter` hooks for GET requests with caching\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:44:45", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "44", "end_line": "45", "text": "- **Mutations**: `useApi` hook for POST/PUT/DELETE with error handling\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:45:46", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "45", "end_line": "46", "text": "- **Route gating**: Routes support `flag`, `enterprise`, and `configFlag` properties\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:46:47", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "46", "end_line": "47", "text": "- **Styling**: MUI `styled()` components with emotion, use `sx` for one-offs\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:47:49", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "47", "end_line": "49", "text": "- **Tracking**: user journeys are tracked using the `useTracking` hook with a `Tracking` object declared in a `<domain>Tracking.ts` file. Never call `trackEvent` directly. Decisions are in `/contributing/ADRs/front-end/tracking.md`. The how-to is in the comments on the types in `/frontend/src/utils/trackingEvents.ts`, on `useTracking` and on the `tracking` prop of `Dialogue`. Read those before adding tracking and adhere to the tracking standards.\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:49:51", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "49", "end_line": "51", "text": "**Stack**: React 18+, Vite, Material-UI (MUI), SWR for server state\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:51:53", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "51", "end_line": "53", "text": "## Enterprise Integration\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:53:55", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "53", "end_line": "55", "text": "Enterprise extends OSS through hooks without forking:\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:55:56", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "55", "end_line": "56", "text": "1. **Entry**: `unleash-enterprise/src/index.ts` wraps OSS `start()`/`create()`\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:56:57", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "56", "end_line": "57", "text": "2. **Hook**: `preRouterHook` runs after OSS init, before route binding\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:57:58", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "57", "end_line": "58", "text": "3. **Extension**: Adds 50+ services, 30+ stores, 50+ controllers\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:58:60", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "58", "end_line": "60", "text": "4. **Gating**: License middleware restricts enterprise features\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:5:7", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "5", "end_line": "7", "text": "## Project Overview\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "System Overview", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:60:62", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "60", "end_line": "62", "text": "**Enterprise-Only Features**: Change Requests, SSO (SAML/OIDC), Service Accounts, Signals & Actions, Insights, SCIM, Private Projects, Release Plans, Safeguards\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "System Overview", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:62:64", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "62", "end_line": "64", "text": "**Combined Interfaces**: `IEnterpriseServices extends IUnleashServices`, `IUnleashEnterpriseStores extends IUnleashStores`\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:64:66", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "64", "end_line": "66", "text": "## Composition Root Pattern\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:66:68", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "66", "end_line": "68", "text": "All dependencies are wired at application startup, not scattered throughout the codebase. All services have a dedicated composition root function to stand up the service.:\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:68:69", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "68", "end_line": "69", "text": "**OSS Composition**:\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:69:70", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "69", "end_line": "70", "text": "- `/src/lib/db/index.ts` → `createStores()` instantiates all stores with Knex connection\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:70:71", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "70", "end_line": "71", "text": "- `/src/lib/services/index.ts` → `createServices()` instantiates all services with stores + config\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:71:73", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "71", "end_line": "73", "text": "- `/src/lib/server-impl.ts` → Orchestrates: DB → Stores → Services → App\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:73:74", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "73", "end_line": "74", "text": "**Enterprise Composition**:\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:74:75", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "74", "end_line": "75", "text": "- `enterprise/src/util/setup-stores.ts` → Creates enterprise stores, merges with OSS stores\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:75:76", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "75", "end_line": "76", "text": "- `enterprise/src/util/setup-services.ts` → Creates enterprise services with combined stores\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:76:78", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "76", "end_line": "78", "text": "- `enterprise/src/create-enterprise-routes.ts` → Wires everything in `preRouterHook`\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:78:80", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "78", "end_line": "80", "text": "**Why this matters**: Never `new` a service/store inline. Always receive dependencies through constructor injection. This enables testing with fakes and keeps the dependency graph explicit.\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:7:9", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "7", "end_line": "9", "text": "Unleash is an open-source feature flagging platform. This repository (OSS) is a monorepo containing:\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "System Overview", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:80:82", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "80", "end_line": "82", "text": "## Read Models vs Write Models\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:82:84", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "82", "end_line": "84", "text": "To avoid overloading stores with complex queries, we separate read and write concerns:\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:84:85", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "84", "end_line": "85", "text": "**Write Models (Stores)**: Handle CRUD operations on single entities\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:85:86", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "85", "end_line": "86", "text": "- Keep queries simple: insert, update, delete, getById\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:86:87", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "86", "end_line": "87", "text": "- Located in `/src/lib/db/` or feature directories\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:87:89", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "87", "end_line": "89", "text": "- Example: `FeatureToggleStore` handles basic feature CRUD\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:89:90", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "89", "end_line": "90", "text": "**Read Models**: Handle complex queries, aggregations, cross-domain queries and denormalized views\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:90:91", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "90", "end_line": "91", "text": "- Optimized for specific read use cases (dashboards, lists, reports)\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:91:92", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "91", "end_line": "92", "text": "- Located in feature `/read-models/` directories\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:92:94", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "92", "end_line": "94", "text": "- Example: `FeatureStrategiesReadModel`, `ProjectOwnersReadModel`, `FeatureSearchReadModel`\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:94:95", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "94", "end_line": "95", "text": "**When to use Read Models**:\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:95:96", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "95", "end_line": "96", "text": "- Query spans multiple tables with complex joins\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:96:97", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "96", "end_line": "97", "text": "- Need denormalized data for performance\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:97:98", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "97", "end_line": "98", "text": "- Building dashboard/overview endpoints\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:98:99", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "98", "end_line": "99", "text": "- Query doesn't map to a single entity's lifecycle\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:99:101", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "99", "end_line": "101", "text": "- You don't want to expose the entire write model and only need one value from another module\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "da85174df5d7a65bd9bf:9:10", "repo": "Unleash/unleash", "file_path": "AGENTS.md", "start_line": "9", "end_line": "10", "text": "- **Backend**: Node.js/TypeScript REST API (`/src`)\n", "t": "description", "p": "Architecture", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:1:3", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "1", "end_line": "3", "text": "## Commit Convention\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Development Process", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:29:30", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "29", "end_line": "30", "text": "Never add Co-Authored-By agents in commit message.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "content", "c": "none"}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:30:32", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "30", "end_line": "32", "text": "Branch naming for issue fixes: `fix-<issue-number>`\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "content", "c": "none"}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:32:34", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "32", "end_line": "34", "text": "## Rolling Playwright\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Maintenance", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:34:35", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "34", "end_line": "35", "text": "1. Run `node roll.js` (or `npm run roll`) to bump `playwright`, `playwright-core`, and `@playwright/test`, refresh `config.d.ts`, and regenerate the README. The script prints the resolved version — use its suffix for the branch name.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Maintenance", "e": "cross_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:35:36", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "35", "end_line": "36", "text": "2. Create a branch: `git checkout -b roll-pw-<version-suffix>`.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:36:37", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "36", "end_line": "37", "text": "3. Run `npm test`. Only proceed if all tests pass.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "cross_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:37:39", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "37", "end_line": "39", "text": "4. Commit with `chore: roll Playwright to <version>`, push, and open a PR against `microsoft/playwright-mcp` with the same title.\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "cross_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:39:41", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "39", "end_line": "41", "text": "## Preparing a Release\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "DevOps", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:3:5", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "3", "end_line": "5", "text": "Semantic commit messages: `label(scope): description`\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "content", "c": "none"}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:41:42", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "41", "end_line": "42", "text": "See [.claude/skills/release.md](.claude/skills/release.md).\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Documentation", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:5:7", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "5", "end_line": "7", "text": "Labels: `fix`, `feat`, `chore`, `docs`, `test`, `devops`\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Development Process", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "db825a2bf33db0bdcc99:7:29", "repo": "microsoft/playwright-mcp", "file_path": "CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "7", "end_line": "29", "text": "```bash\ngit checkout -b fix-39562\n# ... make changes ...\ngit add <changed-files>\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(proxy): handle SOCKS proxy authentication\n\nFixes: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/issues/39562\nEOF\n)\"\ngit push origin fix-39562\ngh pr create --repo microsoft/playwright --head username:fix-39562 \\\n  --title \"fix(proxy): handle SOCKS proxy authentication\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n- <describe the change very! briefly>\n\nFixes https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/issues/39562\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Development Process", "e": "per_event", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dbc1c8af80d748a0bddc:1:4", "repo": "GoogleContainerTools/skaffold", "file_path": "vendor/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/CLAUDE.md", "start_line": "1", "end_line": "4", "text": "# Instructions for Claude Code\n\n@AGENTS.md\n", "t": "directive", "p": "AI Integration", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:10:15", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "10", "end_line": "15", "text": "1. **Test Location & Scope:**\n   - All op tests must be placed in `max/tests/tests/graph/ops/`\n   - Tests should only build graphs, not execute them\n   - Graph execution tests belong in `SDK/integration-test/python/graph/`\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:15:20", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "15", "end_line": "20", "text": "2. **Required Test Components:**\n   - Hypothesis-based tests for valid input ranges\n   - Hypothesis-based tests for invalid inputs\n   - Specific test cases for error message validation\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:1:6", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "1", "end_line": "6", "text": "---\ndescription: Rules for generating tests for graph API operations\nglobs: \nalwaysApply: false\n---\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:20:25", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "20", "end_line": "25", "text": "3. **Test Structure:**\n   - Each op should have its own test file (e.g., `test_<op_name>.py`)\n   - Tests should be fast to run\n   - Focus on input validation and error handling\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:25:27", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "25", "end_line": "27", "text": "## Testing Requirements\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:27:32", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "27", "end_line": "32", "text": "1. **Valid Input Testing:**\n   - Use hypothesis to test valid input ranges\n   - Assert expected invariants for valid inputs\n   - Cover edge cases within valid ranges\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:32:37", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "32", "end_line": "37", "text": "2. **Invalid Input Testing:**\n   - Use hypothesis to test invalid inputs\n   - Assert Python exceptions are raised\n   - Focus on behavior, not specific error messages\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:37:42", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "37", "end_line": "42", "text": "3. **Error Message Testing:**\n   - Test specific error messages without hypothesis\n   - Use concrete test cases\n   - Ensure error messages are user-friendly and actionable\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:42:47", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "42", "end_line": "47", "text": "## Documentation Reference\n\nFor detailed testing principles and examples, refer to:\n`SDK/docs/GraphAPITesting.md`\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Documentation", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:47:49", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "47", "end_line": "49", "text": "## Quality Guidelines\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:49:54", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "49", "end_line": "54", "text": "1. **Error Messages:**\n   - Must be informative and actionable\n   - Should help users understand how to fix the issue\n   - Must be validated through specific test cases\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:54:59", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "54", "end_line": "59", "text": "2. **Test Coverage:**\n   - Cover all valid input ranges\n   - Test all known invalid inputs\n   - Validate all error messages\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "content", "c": "project"}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:59:63", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "59", "end_line": "63", "text": "3. **Performance:**\n   - Tests should be fast to run\n   - Avoid unnecessary test cases\n   - Focus on critical paths and edge cases\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:6:8", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "6", "end_line": "8", "text": "# Unit Test Guidelines for Graph API Operations\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "dcecd8d2c013dfc18def:8:10", "repo": "modular/modular", "file_path": "max/tests/tests/graph/ops/.cursor/rules/ops-testing.mdc", "start_line": "8", "end_line": "10", "text": "## Core Testing Principles\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Testing", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:100:104", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "100", "end_line": "104", "text": "- **Technical Risks**: Latency, cost, or dependency failures.\n\n---\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Development Process", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:104:106", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "104", "end_line": "106", "text": "## Implementation Guidelines\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:106:108", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "106", "end_line": "108", "text": "### DO (Always)\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Implementation Details", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:108:109", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "108", "end_line": "109", "text": "- **Define Testing**: For AI systems, specify how to test and validate output quality.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "Testing", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:109:111", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "109", "end_line": "111", "text": "- **Iterate**: Present a draft and ask for feedback on specific sections.\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "AI Integration", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:111:113", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "111", "end_line": "113", "text": "### DON'T (Avoid)\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:113:114", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "113", "end_line": "114", "text": "- **Skip Discovery**: Never write a PRD without asking at least 2 clarifying questions first.\n", "t": "directive", "p": "AI Integration", "e": "cross_event", "c": "task"}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:114:118", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "114", "end_line": "118", "text": "- **Hallucinate Constraints**: If the user didn't specify a tech stack, ask or label it as `TBD`.\n\n---\n\n", "t": "directive", "p": "AI Integration", "e": "semantic_only", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:118:120", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "118", "end_line": "120", "text": "## Example: Intelligent Search System\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}, {"id": "e2500d7a18282d7a2708:120:122", "repo": "github/awesome-copilot", "file_path": "skills/prd/SKILL.md", "start_line": "120", "end_line": "122", "text": "### 1. Executive Summary\n\n", "t": "description", "p": "Documentation", "e": "", "c": ""}]